  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>In a medium saucepan, bring the water (for the rice) to boil.</li>\n• <li>Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.</li>\n• <li>Cook for 10 mins, then remove the pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10 mins. </li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee6e79e2c370e48f55fb/step-e6df4b00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Meanwhile, thinly slice zucchini into half-moons. Cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks. </li>\n• <li>Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.</li>\n• <li>In a medium bowl, combine sweet soy seasoning, honey and soy sauce and water (for the sauce) </li>\n• <li>In a small bowl, combine sriracha (add less if you&#39;re sensitive to heat!) and mayonnaise.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee6e79e2c370e48f55fb/step-eee6d110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.</li>\n• <li>Cook capsicum and zucchini, tossing, until softened, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a bowl.</li>\n• <li>Return pan to medium-high heat and cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 mins. Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded.</li>\n• <li>And add honey soy mixture and veggies, tossing until well combined, 1 min. </li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee6e79e2c370e48f55fb/step-c3892420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Divide rice and tofu stir fry between bowls. </li>\n• <li>Drizzle with sriracha mayo.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee6e79e2c370e48f55fb/step-e7c4f330.jpg"
    }
  ]
